WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
The code looks right. But does it connect?

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Weftgate checks environment variables, imports, and FastAPI route references.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Run weftgate check app/broken.py. Trace each reference to repository evidence.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Three broken references. Suggestions: requests, DATABASE_URL, and health.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Apply the suggested names and run the same check.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.000
The corrected fixture returns ACCEPT, with exit code zero.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:41.000
A dynamic environment key returns REVIEW. Uncertainty does not block.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:48.000
One verification engine for CLI, MCP, GitHub Action, and hooks.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:58.000
pip install weftgate. Run weftgate audit. Try it and share a reproduction.
